          "author": "Peppa Pig",
          "description": "Peaceful, calming, and beautifully soothing, this lullaby album offers a gentle collection of tracks designed to create the perfect atmosphere for relaxation and quiet time. Whether it's winding down after a busy day, easing into naptime, or setting the mood for bedtime, each song is crafted to help little ones feel safe, comforted, and ready to rest. With soft melodies, tranquil rhythms, and a warm, nurturing tone, it's an ideal playlist to press play for preschoolers during moments of calm.",
